				type: 'description',
				html: '\r\n          <h4>Description:</h4>\r\n          <SubHeading />\r\n          <LanguageSets />\r\n          <Paragraphs>\r\n            <p><div class="image-box">Image: WEB-0199_egret</div>Herons are fairly large birds with long necks, long beaks, and usually with long legs as well. They stand or walk slowly in shallow water in rivers, dams, ponds, or lakes looking into the water for small fish, which they catch by suddenly darting their heads into the water. They fly with slow wing-beats.</p>\r\n          </Paragraphs>\r\n        '
