		category: 'Flora',
		content:
			'<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">other</div>\r\n          <h4><u>References:</u> to “pine” in Scripture are all tentative, since there is considerable uncertainty among scholars regarding the identity of all the conifers. Probably two kinds of pine are referred to and they are quite different in form and habitat.</h4>\r\n          <SubHeading />\r\n          <LanguageSets />\r\n        </div>',
