				html: '\r\n          <h4>Special significance:</h4>\r\n          <SubHeading />\r\n          <LanguageSets />\r\n          <Paragraphs>\r\n            <p>All the references cited above are in rhetorical contexts where the quality of thorniness or pain is in focus. Nettles were and are a nuisance on many farms. They tend to sprout in abandoned settlements, and they are often cited with jackals and owls to illustrate the desolation of a nation by their enemies. Today the tops of the growing nettles are used for food in many places. Extracts from nettles are used to treat arthritis and hay fever and as an ingredient of shampoos to control dandruff.</p>\r\n          </Paragraphs>\r\n        '
