				html: '\r\n        <h4>Description:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <image id="WEB-0966_goad_oxen_en.jpg" />The goad was a stick, sometimes tipped with a metal point (<i>darvan</i>), used in driving draft animals or herds of domestic animals, such as sheep. The goad had to be long enough to reach the animal from the driver’s position, thus 1-2 meters (3-6 feet).</p>\r\n          <p>———</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      '
