				html: '\r\n        <h4>Translation:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>A generic term for “net” may be used in languages that do not require that a distinction be made.</p>\r\n          <p>In <s>G04001304700016</s> the actual form of the net is not so important. What is significant is that the net was sufficiently large to catch a large number of different kinds of fish.</p>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <s>H03500101500014 H03500101600010 H03500101700010</s>: See the comments at <l>1.3.1.1 Casting net&lt;REALIA:1.3.1.1&gt;</l>.</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n        <BibleImages>\r\n          <BibleImage id="WEB-0335_drag_net">\r\n            <FileName>WEB-0335_drag_net.jpg</FileName>\r\n            <Collection>WEB</Collection>\r\n            <Copyright>George Louis Faber, Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons</Copyright>\r\n            <Caption>Men drawing in a dragnet</Caption>\r\n          </BibleImage>\r\n        </BibleImages>\r\n      '
