			'<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">references</div>\r\n        <h4>References:</h4>\r\n        <LanguageSets>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>חרשׁ, חָרָשׁ</em> \r\n            [charash] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H00202801100004</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203503500018</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203802300018</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02401700100020</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>חֲרֹשֶׁת</em> \r\n            [charosheth] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H00203100500006</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203100500018</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203503300006</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203503300018</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>פתח</em> \r\n            [pathach (verb)] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H00202800900016</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00202801100012</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00202803600014</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203900600020</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01100703600004</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01400200600070</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01400201300098</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01400300700032</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H03800300900032</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>פִּתּוּחַ</em> \r\n            [pituach] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H00202801100008</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00202802100026</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00202803600018</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203900600022</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203901400026</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203903000028</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01400200600072</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01400201300102</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01907400600010</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H03800300900034</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>קלע, מִקְלַעַת</em> \r\n            [qala‘ (verb), miqla‘ath] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H01100601800014</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01100602900016</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01100602900020</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01100603200014</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01100603200018</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01100603500004</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01100703100054</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Greek</strong>\r\n            <em>γλύμμα</em> \r\n            [glumma] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>L07103802700026</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>L07104501100006</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Greek</strong>\r\n            <em>γλυφή</em> \r\n            [glufē] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>L07001802400030</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Greek</strong>\r\n            <em>γλύφω</em> \r\n            [glufō (verb)] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>L07001301300030</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>L07103802700024</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Greek</strong>\r\n            <em>ἐγγλύφω</em> \r\n            [egglufō (verb)] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>L07701302900044</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Greek</strong>\r\n            <em>κολάπτω</em> \r\n            [kolaptō (verb)] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>L07104501100028</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>L07900202700032</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </LanguageSets>\r\n      </div>\n<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">description</div>\r\n        <h4>Description:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <image id="WEB-0341_engraving_ring.jpg" />An engraving was a picture or words made by scratching lines in a hard surface such as stone, metal, or gems. A carving was a figure usually made out of wood, using a knife or another sharp implement.</p>\r\n          <p>———</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      </div>\n<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">translation</div>\r\n        <h4>Translation:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>In some languages it may be necessary to choose a verb for “engrave” according to the surface that is being used.</p>\r\n          <p>The Hebrew word <i>charosheth</i> is used in <s>H00203100500006</s> and <s>H00203503300006</s> to describe both engraving and carving.</p>\r\n          <p>The specific action described in <s>L07103802700024</s> is “engrave seals” (<a>NJB</a>; compare the even more precise <a>RSV</a> rendering “cut the signets of seals”; see also the discussion at <l>10.2 Seal, signet ring, ring&lt;REALIA:10.2&gt;</l>). The point of the passage is the diligence and precision with which the engraver works. Where there is no exact equivalent of signets or seals, it is possible to refer to some other craftsman’s work that requires precision and can be done in great variety.</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n        <BibleImages>\r\n          <BibleImage id="WEB-0341_engraving_ring">\r\n            <FileName>WEB-0341_engraving_ring.jpg</FileName>\r\n            <Collection>WEB</Collection>\r\n            <Copyright>© The Portable Antiquities Scheme/ The Trustees of the British Museum, CC BY-SA 2.0, via Wikimedia Commons</Copyright>\r\n            <Caption>Engraving on a ring</Caption>\r\n          </BibleImage>\r\n        </BibleImages>\r\n      </div>',
