				html: '\r\n        <h4>Usage:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>The ceremony for installing a person in the office of king or priest included pouring olive oil over his head (see <l>1.10.5 Anointing oil&lt;REALIA:1.10.5&gt;</l>). The oil was kept in and poured from the anointing horn/flask, used only for this special ceremony.</p>\r\n          <p>———</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      '
