				html: '\r\n        <h4>Description and usage:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <image id="WEB-0373_awl.jpg" />The awl was a hand tool with a narrow point used for boring holes in wood, leather, or other substances. The point could be made of metal, bone, or stone. The awl sometimes had a handle made of wood or bone.</p>\r\n          <p>———</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      '
