		title: 'Helmet',
		category: 'Realia',
		content:
			'<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">references</div>\r\n        <h4>References:</h4>\r\n        <LanguageSets>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>כּוֹבַע</em> \r\n            [kova‘] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H00901700500004</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01402601400026</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02305901700016</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02404600400022</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02602701000026</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02603800500018</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>מָעוֹז, רֹאשׁ</em> \r\n            [ma‘oz ro’sh] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H01906000900016</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01910800900014</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>קוֹבַע</em> \r\n            [qova‘] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H00901703800018</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02602302400032</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Greek</strong>\r\n            <em>περικεφαλαία</em> \r\n            [perikefalaia] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>G04900601700006</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>G05200500800024</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>L07700603500036</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Greek</strong>\r\n            <em>κόρυς</em> \r\n            [korus] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>L07000501800012</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </LanguageSets>\r\n      </div>\n<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">description</div>\r\n        <h4>Description:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <image id="WEB-0971_helmet.jpg" />The helmet was protective armor covering the head. In some helmet designs there were flaps extending down over the ears or even to the neck. Among the Israelites and their immediate neighbors, helmets were usually made of leather. Helmets made of metal were rare and were generally imported from countries to the east and north. See the illustration at <l>2.3.1 Sheath, scabbard&lt;REALIA:2.3.1&gt;</l>.</p>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <image id="WEB-0972_helmet.jpg" />———</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      </div>\n<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">translation</div>\r\n        <h4>Translation:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <image id="WEB-0973_helmet.jpg" />For languages having no term for “helmet,” translators may use a descriptive equivalent, such as “protection for the head” or “covering for the head in fighting.” The figurative expression “helmet of salvation” in <s>H02305901700016</s> and <s>G04900601701000</s> may be rendered “salvation, which is like a protection for the head.”</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n        <BibleImages>\r\n          <BibleImage id="WEB-0971_helmet">\r\n            <FileName>WEB-0971_helmet.jpg</FileName>\r\n            <Collection>WEB</Collection>\r\n            <Copyright>© Public Domain - Wikimedia Commons</Copyright>\r\n            <Caption>Helmet</Caption>\r\n          </BibleImage>\r\n          <BibleImage id="WEB-0972_helmet">\r\n            <FileName>WEB-0972_helmet.jpg</FileName>\r\n            <Collection>WEB</Collection>\r\n            <Copyright>© Public Domain - Wikimedia Commons</Copyright>\r\n            <Caption>Helmet in place on a soldier\'s head</Caption>\r\n          </BibleImage>\r\n          <BibleImage id="WEB-0973_helmet">\r\n            <FileName>WEB-0973_helmet.jpg</FileName>\r\n            <Collection>WEB</Collection>\r\n            <Copyright>© Jona Lendering - Wikimedia Commons</Copyright>\r\n            <Caption>Picture of a helmet worn by a soldier</Caption>\r\n          </BibleImage>\r\n        </BibleImages>\r\n      </div>',
