			'<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">references</div>\r\n        <h4>References:</h4>\r\n        <LanguageSets>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>אַמָּה</em> \r\n            [’amah] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H02300600400006</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>אֹמְנָה</em> \r\n            [’omnah] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H01201801600030</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>מְזוּזָה</em> \r\n            [mzuzah] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H00201200700022</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00201202200046</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00201202300040</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00202100600030</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00500600900008</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00501102000008</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00701600300050</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00900100900040</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01100603100024</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01100603300016</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01100700500014</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02000803400026</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02305700800014</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02604102100006</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02604300800014</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02604300800018</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02604501900024</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02604501900052</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H02604600200028</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>סַף</em> \r\n            [saf] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H01400300700018</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </LanguageSets>\r\n      </div>\n<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">description and usage</div>\r\n        <h4>Description and usage:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <image id="OAI-0029_doorpost_lintel_en.png" />Entrances such as doorways and gateways were rectangular. The two sides of the doorway were sometimes lined with wood, to which the hinges of the door could be attached. The doorposts were these side poles of the doorway. They also served to support the structure above the doorway.</p>\r\n          <p>———</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      </div>\n<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">translation</div>\r\n        <h4>Translation:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>Where technical terms for the doorframe parts do not exist, a descriptive phrase may be used; for example, in <s>H00201202200046</s>, where <a>RSV</a> refers to “the lintel and the two doorposts,” <a>NCV</a> has “the sides and tops of the doorframes.”</p>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <s>H01201801600030</s>: The Hebrew word <i>’omnah</i> only occurs here in Scripture, and its meaning is uncertain. The meaning of the verb root from which it is derived is “to carry, support,” and it could refer either to supporting columns for a large room or to posts that support a door opening. Most translations understand it in this second way and say “doorposts.”</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n        <BibleImages>\r\n          <BibleImage id="OAI-0029_doorpost_lintel_en">\r\n            <FileName>OAI-0029_doorpost_lintel_en.png</FileName>\r\n            <Collection>OPEN-AI</Collection>\r\n            <Copyright>Image generated by ChatGPT using OpenAI technology</Copyright>\r\n            <Caption>Doorpost and lintel of a door</Caption>\r\n          </BibleImage>\r\n        </BibleImages>\r\n      </div>',
