				html: '\r\n        <h4>Description and usage:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <image id="WEB-0415_fence.jpg" />The fence was a structure for enclosing an area. Fences in the land of Israel were most often made of stone, less often (and only as a temporary structure) of sticks and brush.</p>\r\n          <p>———</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      '
