				html: '\r\n        <h4>Translation:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>Athletic contests in ancient Greece were inseparably connected with the religious cult. This is an important aspect of the discus throwing in <s>L07800401400062</s>, and this aspect should be preserved in translation, even if it means not mentioning the specific sport of throwing the discus; for example, <a>GNT</a> renders the last part of this verse as “they would rush off to take part in the games that were forbidden by our Law.”</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      '
