			'<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">references</div>\r\n        <h4>References:</h4>\r\n        <LanguageSets>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Aramaic</strong>\r\n            <em>בֵ֨ית גְּנַז</em> \r\n            [beyth gnaz] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>A01500501700020</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>A01500600100020</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Greek</strong>\r\n            <em>βιβλιοθήκη</em> \r\n            [bibliothēkē] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>L07800201300040</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Greek</strong>\r\n            <em>βιβλιοφυλάκιον</em> \r\n            [bibliofulakion] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>L08100602000020</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>L08100602200020</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </LanguageSets>\r\n      </div>\n<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">description and usage</div>\r\n        <h4>Description and usage:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <image id="OAI-0044_library_with_scrolls.png" />The library was a place for the storage of official or public documents. There was no distinctive structure for such a building.</p>\r\n          <p>———</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      </div>\n<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">translation</div>\r\n        <h4>Translation:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>In <s>L07800400900000</s> several translations render the Greek word <i>biblion</i> as “archives” (<a>RSV</a>, <a>GNT</a>). However, here this word refers more to “books” or “records” rather than to the place were those records were kept.</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n        <BibleImages>\r\n          <BibleImage id="OAI-0044_library_with_scrolls">\r\n            <FileName>OAI-0044_library_with_scrolls.png</FileName>\r\n            <Collection>OPEN-AI</Collection>\r\n            <Copyright>Image generated by ChatGPT using OpenAI technology</Copyright>\r\n            <Caption>\r\n            </Caption>\r\n          </BibleImage>\r\n        </BibleImages>\r\n      </div>',
