			'<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">references</div>\r\n        <h4>References:</h4>\r\n        <LanguageSets>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>אֹהֶל, מוֹעֵד</em> \r\n            [’ohel, ’ohel mo‘ed] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H00203300700012</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203300700022</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203300700031</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203300800008</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203300800017</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203300800025</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203300900007</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203300900016</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203301000013</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203301000023</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203301100031</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00401101600026</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00401102400025</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00401102600031</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00401200400016</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00401200500011</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00503101400017</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00503101400029</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00503101500006</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00503101500018</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00601800100012</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00601905100029</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01400100300018</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01400100600014</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01400101300014</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01400500500008</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H01400500500019</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </LanguageSets>\r\n      </div>\n<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">description</div>\r\n        <h4>Description:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>If Osborn is correct in his conclusion that there were two different tents (see <l>3.15 Tent of Meeting and Tabernacle&lt;REALIA:3.15&gt;</l>), then the dimensions given in the Pentateuch refer to the Tabernacle, and we have no actual description given for the Tent of Meeting. It was evidently a small structure, one that a person could set up alone.</p>\r\n          <p>———</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      </div>\n<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">translation</div>\r\n        <h4>Translation:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>See the discussion at <l>3.15 Tent of Meeting and Tabernacle&lt;REALIA:3.15&gt;</l> above.</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      </div>',
