				html: '\r\n        <h4>Description and usage:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <image id="WEB-0437_pavement_roman_petra.jpg" />Pavement was an area paved with flat blocks of stone to form a courtyard (not a road). “The Pavement” was the name given to the inner courtyard of the Roman fortress of Antonia, which bordered the northwest corner of the Temple complex in Jerusalem.</p>\r\n          <p>———</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      '
