				type: 'description and usage',
				html: '\r\n        <h4>Description and usage:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <image id="WEB-0467_burial.jpg" />The tomb was a construction for the burial of the dead. Since much of the land of Israel, especially in the hilly regions, has little topsoil, tombs were often hewn out of bedrock. In some cases natural caves were used for burial. The entrance to a tomb was closed with a stone (see <l>4.8.1.1 Stone for closing a tomb&lt;REALIA:4.8.1.1&gt;</l>).</p>\r\n          <p>———</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      '
