				html: '\r\n        <h4>Translation:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>Where beds with posts are not known, it is possible to translate the verses listed above without reference to the structure of the bed. So <s>L06801300600080</s> may be rendered “She went to the head of the bed and took down Holofernes’ sword from the place where it was hanging.” <s>L06801300900030</s> b may be translated “she pulled down the mosquito netting from the bed.”</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      '
