			'<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">other</div>\r\n        <h4>People in biblical times ate food from plates and bowls, as is familiar in most cultures today, but it seems that they did not use implements to lift the food from the plate to their mouth. This was done with the right hand.</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n      </div>',
