				html: '\r\n        <h4>Description:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <image id="WEB-0514_cymbals.jpg" />Cymbals were a percussion instrument consisting of two metal discs that were struck together in order to make a shrill, clashing sound. There were two types of cymbals: (1) flat metal plates that were struck together, and (2) metal cones, one of which was brought down on top of the other, on the open end.</p>\r\n          <p>———</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      '
