				html: '\r\n        <h4>Translation:</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>A sail may be rendered in some languages as “piece of cloth to make the ship move” or “cloth on the ship to catch the wind.” In <s>G04402704000036</s> the Greek word <i>artemōn</i> may refer to the foresail, that is, a relatively small sail toward the prow or front of the ship.</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n        <BibleImages>\r\n        </BibleImages>\r\n      '
