		title: 'Beqa',
		category: 'Realia',
		content:
			'<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">references</div>\r\n        <h4>References:</h4>\r\n        <LanguageSets>\r\n          <div class="lang-set"><strong>Hebrew</strong>\r\n            <em>בֶּקַע</em> \r\n            [beqa‘] \r\n            <div class="ref-list">\r\n              <Reference>H00102402200032</Reference>\r\n              <Reference>H00203802600002</Reference>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </LanguageSets>\r\n        <Paragraphs />\r\n      </div>\n<div class="section-box"><div class="section-label">other</div>\r\n        <h4>In <s>H00203802600002</s> a <i>beqa‘</i> is defined as half a shekel. In <s>H00102402200032</s> it is the weight of a gold nose ring. <a>NRSV</a> just converts it to the shekel weight by saying “a gold nose-ring weighing a half shekel.” The <i>beqa‘</i> equals 10 gerahs.</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n      </div>',
