				html: '\r\n        <h4>The <i>hin</i> was a liquid measure for wine and oil for the sacrifices and for mixing the incense to be used in the Tabernacle.</h4>\r\n        <SubHeading />\r\n        <LanguageSets />\r\n        <Paragraphs>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <s>H00301903600016</s>: See the comments under <i>’eyfah</i> above, <l>11.3.1.3 Ephah&lt;REALIA:11.3.1.3&gt;</l>.</p>\r\n          <p>\r\n            <s>H02600401100016</s>: <a>GW</a> and <a>NCV</a> give the amount of water Ezekiel can drink as he acts out the siege as “two-thirds of a quart.” <a>GNT</a> conveys the picture nicely with “two cups” (similarly <a>CEV</a> “two large cups”).</p>\r\n        </Paragraphs>\r\n      '
